@startuml
title UC-PL From the investment program to the enacted budget (cohort P, E, B)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber
actor "Planning and budget officer o…" as ROLE_PLANNER
boundary "Planning and budget units" as B_UNIT_NGA_PLAN
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_PLANNER
entity "record" as E_S_PIP_CALL
participant "PIPOL" as N_SYS_PIPOL
actor "DEPDev PIP and TRIP secretari…" as ROLE_DEPDEV
boundary "PIP and TRIP secretariats" as B_UNIT_DEPDEV_PIP
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_DEPDEV
entity "PIPOL" as E_SYS_PIPOL
entity "record" as E_S_BUDGET_CALL
participant "OSBPS: Tier 2 forms" as N_MOD_OSBPS_T2
actor "Personnel officer" as ROLE_PERSONNEL
boundary "Personnel unit" as B_UNIT_NGA_PERS
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_PERSONNEL
participant "GMIS: PSIPOP" as N_MOD_GMIS_PSIPOP
actor "DBM (bureaus and approving of…" as ROLE_DBM
boundary "BPMS" as B_SYS_BPMS
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM
participant "BPMS" as N_SYS_BPMS
actor "Congress" as ROLE_CONGRESS
boundary "Congress" as B_INST_CONGRESS
control "check (not stated)" as C_not_stated_ROLE_CONGRESS
entity "BPMS" as E_SYS_BPMS
boundary "e-Budget (DBM)" as B_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM
entity "record" as E_S_GAA
participant "e-Budget (DBM)" as N_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM
entity "e-Budget (DBM)" as E_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM
== PL-01 Encode and endorse programs and projects in PIPOL ==
ROLE_PLANNER -> B_UNIT_NGA_PLAN : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_PLAN -> C_not_stated_ROLE_PLANNER : Encode and endorse programs and projects in PIPOL
C_not_stated_ROLE_PLANNER -> E_S_PIP_CALL : use: Joint call for the PIP and TRIP issued
C_not_stated_ROLE_PLANNER -> N_SYS_PIPOL : F001 Programs and projects encoded and endorsed in PIPOL
== PL-02 Validate the entries against the PIP criteria ==
ROLE_DEPDEV -> B_UNIT_DEPDEV_PIP : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_DEPDEV_PIP -> C_not_stated_ROLE_DEPDEV : Validate the entries against the PIP criteria
C_not_stated_ROLE_DEPDEV -> E_SYS_PIPOL : write: Entry validated in the PIP or TRIP
== PL-03 Enter the budget proposal in OSBPS ==
ROLE_PLANNER -> B_UNIT_NGA_PLAN : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_PLAN -> C_not_stated_ROLE_PLANNER : Enter the budget proposal in OSBPS
C_not_stated_ROLE_PLANNER -> E_S_BUDGET_CALL : use: Budget Call issued
C_not_stated_ROLE_PLANNER -> N_MOD_OSBPS_T2 : F003 Budget proposal forms in OSBPS
C_not_stated_ROLE_PLANNER -> E_SYS_PIPOL : read: Entry validated in the PIP or TRIP
== PL-04 Update the positions in GMIS ==
ROLE_PERSONNEL -> B_UNIT_NGA_PERS : System or office where the act takes place
B_UNIT_NGA_PERS -> C_not_stated_ROLE_PERSONNEL : Update the positions in GMIS
C_not_stated_ROLE_PERSONNEL -> N_MOD_GMIS_PSIPOP : F004 Updated positions in GMIS
== PL-05 Build the proposed budget ==
ROLE_DBM -> B_SYS_BPMS : System or office where the act takes place
B_SYS_BPMS -> C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM : Build the proposed budget
C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM -> N_SYS_BPMS : F005A Proposals in BPMS
C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM -> N_SYS_BPMS : F005B Filled positions in BPMS
== PL-06 Enact the budget ==
ROLE_CONGRESS -> B_INST_CONGRESS : System or office where the act takes place
B_INST_CONGRESS -> C_not_stated_ROLE_CONGRESS : Enact the budget
C_not_stated_ROLE_CONGRESS -> E_SYS_BPMS : write: National Expenditure Program submitted to Congress
== PL-07 Load the enacted budget in the e-Budget of DBM ==
ROLE_DBM -> B_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM : System or office where the act takes place
B_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM -> C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM : Load the enacted budget in the e-Budget of DBM
C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM -> E_SYS_BPMS : use: National Expenditure Program submitted to Congress
C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM -> E_S_GAA : write: General Appropriations Act signed
C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM -> N_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM : F006 Enacted budget in the e-Budget of DBM
== PL-08 Make the appropriation available for release ==
ROLE_DBM -> B_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM : System or office where the act takes place
B_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM -> C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM : Make the appropriation available for release
C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM -> E_S_GAA : use: General Appropriations Act signed
C_not_stated_ROLE_DBM -> E_SYS_EBUDGET_DBM : write: Appropriation available (a line of the GAA)
@enduml
